# Phase 1 — Define the Roboticela architecture

Your final architecture should be approximately:

```text
                         Roboticela OS
                              │
                       ┌──────┴──────┐
                       │ RoboShell    │
                       └──────┬──────┘
                              │
                         Robo Runtime
                              │
       ┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐
       │                      │                      │
    RoboHTML                RoboCSS                RoboJS
       │                      │                      │
       └──────────────┬───────┴──────────────────────┘
                      │
                    RoboDOM
                      │
                 RoboLayout
                      │
                  RoboPaint
                      │
                 RoboRender
                      │
               RoboCompositor
                      │
               RoboGraphics
                      │
             Roboticela Platform
                      │
                Roboticela OS
```

This becomes your master architecture document.

