## How to use the huge Chromium source

This is the part that will save you the most time.

**Do not read Chromium from top to bottom.**

For every subsystem, use this cycle:

```text
                    chromium/
                       │
                       ▼
             Identify subsystem
                       │
                       ▼
             Understand behavior
                       │
                       ▼
            Write Robo specification
                       │
                       ▼
             Design C interfaces
                       │
                       ▼
             Implement in runtime/
                       │
                       ▼
                    Tests
                       │
                       ▼
              Mark subsystem done
```

For example:

```text
Chromium HTML implementation
          ↓
"What does an HTML parser need to do?"
          ↓
RoboHTML specification
          ↓
runtime/web/html/*.c
          ↓
HTML tests
          ↓
Done
```

Then move on.

