### Where you are now

You are currently around:

**Goal 3.11 — Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm.**

So the immediate remaining Unicode work is approximately:

```text
3.11  Bidi                    ← current
3.12  Script detection
3.13  Emoji properties
3.14  Unicode data infrastructure
        ↓
